    "name": "RFID Attendance System - Academic Lab Experiments (Expt 1 & 6)",
    "description": "Complete REST API Testing Collection for University Lab Course.\nSatisfies Expt 1 (LO1: REST Architecture, CRUD, and Postman testing) and Expt 6 (LO4: Spring Boot Backend CRUD).",
